OrcXM T-Display handheld firmware
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

This program is linked with ESPARGOS/esp-sdr (GPL-3.0). The combined
firmware is GPL-3.0-or-later. font8x8_basic.h is public domain
(Daniel Hepper, IBM VGA).

The capture path is spectrum presence only. It does not demodulate
and it does not touch the SiriusXM cipher.
